stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> PAYABLE
  PAYABLE --> PENDING: initiated, payable moves to in-transit
  PENDING --> SUCCEEDED: confirmed success
  PENDING --> FAILED: confirmed failure
  PENDING --> UNKNOWN: timeout or ambiguous response
  UNKNOWN --> SUCCEEDED: independent evidence of success
  UNKNOWN --> FAILED: independent evidence of failure
  FAILED --> FAILED_UNRETURNED: principal not yet back
  FAILED_UNRETURNED --> FAILED_RESOLVED: return seen in statement
  SUCCEEDED --> [*]
  FAILED_RESOLVED --> NEW_ITEM: restored payable, only a NEW payout item
  NEW_ITEM --> PAYABLE
